@startuml
skinparam participantPadding 10
actor Prescriber
actor Pharmacist
actor Insurer
participant "Chain: Attestation Registry" as Chain
participant Gateway
participant "Storage" as Storage
participant "Verifier (Pharmacy/Client)" as Verifier

== Issue ==
Prescriber -> Prescriber: sign MedicationRequest (sig_P)
Prescriber -> Storage: store ciphertext -> CID_MR
Prescriber -> Chain: anchor hash(CID_MR), sig_P ref (status=ISSUED)

== Dispense ==
Pharmacist -> Chain: fetch anchor/sig_P, verify
Pharmacist -> Pharmacist: sign MedicationDispense (sig_Ph)
Pharmacist -> Storage: store -> CID_MD
Pharmacist -> Chain: update attestation (attach sig_Ph, status=DISPENSED)

== Coverage (optional) ==
Insurer -> Chain: verify prior sigs
Insurer -> Insurer: sign coverage (sig_I)
Insurer -> Chain: update attestation (sig_I, status=APPROVED)

== Aggregate ==
Chain -> Chain: aggregate sigs (BLS or hash set) -> aggSig
Chain: record {CID_MR, CID_MD, aggSig, status}

== Verify ==
Verifier -> Chain: get attestation {aggSig/sig set, status}
Verifier -> Storage: fetch CID_MR/CID_MD ciphertexts
Verifier -> Verifier: verify sigs vs on-chain hashes
Verifier -> Verifier: decrypt + render
@enduml
